    "id": "standard-debooks-org-ebooks-theodore-roosevelt-a-book-lovers-holidays-in-the-open",
    "title": "A Book-Lover’s Holidays in the Open",
    "deck": "Theodore Roosevelt — Outdoorsman and former U.S. president Theodore Roosevelt weaves his love of reading into the stories of his travels through the Americas.",
    "source": "Standard Ebooks",
    "sourceId": "standard-ebooks",
